{"version":1,"key":"card:671","content":{"id":671,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"inert ","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"是 HTML 的一个全局布尔属性，它指示浏览器忽略该元素以及子元素，无法与该元素进行任何交互，看得见摸不着。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"inert","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性后："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无法触发任何鼠标事件，包括点击、鼠标移动、触摸、指针事件等"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"文本内容无法选中，就像设置了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"user-select: none","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 一样"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无法被聚焦，也无法触发 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"focus","code":true},{"text":" 事件","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无法被浏览器搜索"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无法编辑原本被编辑的内容，包括 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"input","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"textarea ","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"和设置了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"contenteditable ","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"属性的元素"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对辅助技术隐藏，屏幕阅读器会完全忽略这部分内容，即使视觉上可见"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可访问"},{"type":"link","url":"https://lastknightcoder.github.io/demos/html-inert/01-basic-inert.html","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此页面"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"进行体验交互。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 CSS 中有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"interactivity","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的属性，它的作用它有两个取值"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"auto","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，默认值，用户处于默认状态，通常是可交互的"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"inert","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，同设置了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"inert","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性一样，元素不可交互"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个 CSS 属性本质上是 HTML "},{"type":"formatted","text":"inert","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 全局属性的 CSS 映射版，但有一个关键的单向限制：HTML 优先级更高，如果 HTML 标签上已经写了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"inert","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性，那么即使在 CSS 中设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"interactivity: auto","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，也无法覆盖它，元素仍然是惰性的。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"warning","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Safari 浏览器不支持 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"interactivity","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Global_attributes/inert","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"HTML inert global attribute"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/interactivity","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"interactivity"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]}]}],"tags":["HTML/inert","CSS/interactivity"],"createTime":1768737934167,"updateTime":1768739054562,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1768739054562}}